  "description": "CIKFOU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H68 Dy4 F6 N6 O20,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.464-3.877 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.06-112.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L)4(OH)2(DMF)2(tfaa)2]·2CH3CN.",
